From bc56da6343ecd8626be29ca0b5ccd31015408579 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 23 Jul 2021 10:44:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-45031] greco: remove duplicate code

Target is to avoid duplicate code accorss different
greco targets(i.e. arm, arc and arc_elf32). In this
patch many functions primarily from arc/common.c which are common
across other targets moved to common/common.c.

Also as preboot_init_pcie_phy_fw_update() function is now non-static
so did the necessary change for gaudi and gaudi2 as well.

Change-Id: Ib2a5778379c819d0f2b381f3d3fdeb84d6546056
Signed-off-by: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
---

